flowchart TB
    accTitle: Independent checks bind approval evidence to the exact artifact being staged
    accDescr: The agent drafts a file. The collector checks the actual file and records its digest. The controller verifies that digest and current run health before the staging broker saves the artifact.

    Draft["Agent drafts a file"]
    Check["Independent collector<br/>Checks the actual file and records its digest"]
    Verify["Controller<br/>Verifies that digest and current run health"]
    Stage["Staging broker<br/>Saves the exact checked artifact"]

    Draft --> Check --> Verify --> Stage
